{
  "version": 1,
  "site": "another-eden.jp",
  "board": "news",
  "strategy": "playwright_html",
  "headers": {
    "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36",
    "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8",
    "Accept-Language": "ja,en;q=0.8"
  },
  "timeout": 30,
  "polite_sleep": {"min": 2, "max": 4},
  "list": {
    "url_template": "https://another-eden.jp/news/",
    "pagination": {"kind": "none"},
    "wait_selector": "#backnumber > li",
    "row_selector": "#backnumber > li",
    "include_notices": true,
    "fields": {
      "post_id": [
        {"from": "css", "selector": "dd a", "attr": "href", "transform": [["regex_extract", "/news/(\\d{8})/"]]}
      ],
      "title": [
        {"from": "css", "selector": "dd a", "text": true, "transform": [["collapse_ws"]]}
      ],
      "url": [
        {"from": "css", "selector": "dd a", "attr": "href", "transform": [["urljoin", "https://another-eden.jp/"]]}
      ],
      "published_at": [
        {"from": "css", "selector": "dt", "text": true, "transform": [["regex_extract", "(\\d{4}\\.\\d{1,2}\\.\\d{1,2})"]]}
      ]
    }
  },
  "article": {
    "fetch_kind": "html",
    "content": [
      {"from": "css", "selector": "article", "html": true},
      {"from": "css", "selector": "main", "html": true}
    ]
  },
  "disable_stealth": true,
  "_source_url": "https://another-eden.jp/news/",
  "_note": "Another Eden 공식 — 정적 HTML shell 만 (httpx fetch 시 #backnumber 비어있음), JS hydration 으로 116 row 채워짐. playwright_html 필수 + wait_selector. disable_stealth: true (anti-bot 아님, stealth-DNS race 회피 — commit 7ee403a flag). post_id=YYYYMMDD URL segment. published_at=dt 안 'YYYY.M.D' 형식. LLM/agentic 가 정적-vs-hydrated 신호 못 잡아 hand-config (2026-05-27 hand-config 잔여)."
}
